<section class="page-reviews-section" style="padding: 5rem 0; background: var(--bg-cream);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <span class="section-subtitle-pill">Verified Community Feedback</span>
    <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: 3.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      Loved by Over 12,000+ Gift Givers
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;">
      Real reviews from real celebrations. Discover why brides, sisters, mothers, and friends trust WrapUpBlooms for their most sentimental gifting moments.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Ratings Breakdown Summary Card -->
  <div class="container" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <div style="background: #FFF; border-radius: 32px; padding: 3rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center;">
      <div style="text-align: center; border-right: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); padding-right: 2rem;">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); line-height: 1;">5.0</div>
        <div style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 6px;">★★★★★</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 1.05rem;">Overall Rating</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Based on 12,418 verified purchases</div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="width: 70px; font-weight: 600;">5 Stars</span>
            <div style="flex: 1; height: 10px; background: var(--bg-petal); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden;">
              <div style="width: 98%; height: 100%; background: var(--primary-rose);"></div>
            </div>
            <span style="width: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep);">98%</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <span style="width: 70px; font-weight: 600;">4 Stars</span>
            <div style="flex: 1; height: 10px; background: var(--bg-petal); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden;">
              <div style="width: 2%; height: 100%; background: var(--accent-rose-gold);"></div>
            </div>
            <span style="width: 50px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep);">2%</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.5;">
            <span style="width: 70px; font-weight: 600;">3 Stars</span>
            <div style="flex: 1; height: 10px; background: var(--bg-petal); border-radius: 999px;"></div>
            <span style="width: 50px; font-weight: 700;">0%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <span>✨ 100% On-Time Shipping</span>
          <span>🌸 100% Engraving Accuracy</span>
          <span>🎀 Zero Glass Breakage Rate</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Verified Reviews Grid -->
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;">
      <div class="review-card" style="background: #FFF; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div class="review-stars" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 8px;">&ldquo;Brought tears to all my bridesmaids!&rdquo;</h4>
        <p class="review-text" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          I ordered 7 personalized leather lipstick keychains for my bridal party and they literally cried when opening the ribbon boxes! The engraving of their individual birth flowers was so crisp and delicate. The built-in mirror is super handy on nights out.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Emily R." style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 0.95rem;">Emily R. &bull; Newport, RI</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-rose); font-weight: 600;">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Bridal Party Order</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" style="background: #FFF; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div class="review-stars" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 8px;">&ldquo;The LED mirror is heavy and high-end.&rdquo;</h4>
        <p class="review-text" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          I was honestly blown away by the weight and quality of the rose gold LED mirror. It doesn't feel plastic or cheap at all. The light is super bright and the 2x magnification is perfect for mascara touch-ups. Saddam and Naina answered my custom text question within 15 minutes!
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Sophia M." style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 0.95rem;">Sophia M. &bull; Austin, TX</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-rose); font-weight: 600;">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Birthday Gift</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" style="background: #FFF; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div class="review-stars" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 8px;">&ldquo;Best Mother's Day gift ever.&rdquo;</h4>
        <p class="review-text" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Bought the bear family wooden puzzle for my mother's 60th birthday with all 5 grandchildren's names etched onto the cubs. She keeps it on her living room mantel and everyone asks where she got it. Beautiful wood finish and arrived in 3 days!
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Jessica T." style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 0.95rem;">Jessica T. &bull; Chicago, IL</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-rose); font-weight: 600;">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Family Keepsake</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card" style="background: #FFF; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-delicate); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);">
        <div class="review-stars" style="color: var(--accent-gold); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">★★★★★</div>
        <h4 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--primary-deep); margin-bottom: 8px;">&ldquo;The velvet jewelry box was so plush.&rdquo;</h4>
        <p class="review-text" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Used this for a weekend trip to Napa Valley. Kept my rings and three necklaces completely knot-free. The gold monogram initial looks like an expensive department store piece. Will be purchasing more for holiday stocking stuffers!
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
          <img src="{{ 'lookbook-4.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Chloe B." style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-deep); font-size: 0.95rem;">Chloe B. &bull; San Diego, CA</div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--primary-rose); font-weight: 600;">🌸 Verified Buyer &bull; Travel Jewelry Case</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem;">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 16px 36px;">
        <span>Contact Us Now to Get Your Mirror</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Reviews Page",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
